# Joins the test god of tools/repro_inc_b0ii.sh in wizard mode (the frozen druid
# is already in wizard mode, so `w` opens the menu). The god's EV_BLESSING runs
# one loop case and prints "B0II ..." lines (bd inc-b0ii).
@while "-- more --" SPACE
w
@choose "Become Divine Champion"
"Break Continue Test God" ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
@dump:b0ii
@quit
